---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy policy" description="How Malejemplo handles data collected on this site.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="fine-print">Last updated September 2026.</p>

      <h2>Who runs this site</h2>
      <p>
        malejemplofilms.com is run by Malejemplo, an individual filmmaker, as a personal project — not
        a registered company. Contact details are on the <a href="/about/#contact">about page</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        If you accept cookies via the banner, we use Google Analytics to understand traffic to this
        site (pages visited, approximate location, device type). No analytics run before you accept,
        and you can change your mind at any time from "Cookie settings" in the footer.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you submit the newsletter or contact form, we collect the email address and message you
        provide, to reply to you or to notify you about new products. We don't sell or share this data.
      </p>

      <h2>Services this site relies on</h2>
      <p>
        This site is a set of static pages with no server or database of its own. A few outside
        services handle specific jobs, and each has its own privacy policy governing the data it
        receives directly:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>GitHub Pages</strong> — hosts and serves this website, and logs visitor requests (including IP address) for its own security/operational purposes.</li>
        <li><strong>Formspree</strong> — receives and delivers the newsletter and contact form submissions.</li>
        <li><strong>Gumroad</strong> — handles GATE.24 downloads and payments; we never see your payment details.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can decline or withdraw analytics consent at any time via "Cookie settings" in the footer,
        and can request your contact/newsletter data be deleted by reaching out via the
        <a href="/about/#contact">contact form</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .narrow {
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  .fine-print {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-fg-muted);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-left: var(--space-2);
  }
</style>
